      "source": [
        "## 10. The CNN architecture\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "[conv 3×3, 32] → BN → ReLU → [conv 3×3, 32] → BN → ReLU → max-pool → dropout     28×28 → 14×14\n",
        "[conv 3×3, 64] → BN → ReLU → [conv 3×3, 64] → BN → ReLU → max-pool → dropout     14×14 → 7×7\n",
        "flatten → [dense 256] → BN → ReLU → dropout → [dense 10]\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Convolution layers** slide small 3 × 3 filters across the image to detect local patterns. Early layers find edges and strokes, and later layers combine them into loops and corners.\n",
        "- **Batch normalisation (BN)** rescales each layer's outputs during training, which makes training faster and more stable.\n",
        "- **Max-pooling** halves the image size, keeping the strongest responses. This makes the network tolerant of small position changes.\n",
        "- **Dropout** randomly switches off units during training to reduce overfitting, the same idea as in Part A.\n",
        "- The final **dense layers** combine everything into 10 class scores."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "FLNfjxUkPwvy",
        "outputId": "6a033d01-0939-434e-a9d2-38b696192653"
      },
      "execution_count": 14,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Trainable parameters: 871,530 \n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "cnn <- nn_module(\n",
        "  initialize = function() {\n",
        "    block <- function(cin, cout) nn_sequential(\n",
        "      nn_conv2d(cin, cout, 3, padding = 1), nn_batch_norm2d(cout), nn_relu(),\n",
        "      nn_conv2d(cout, cout, 3, padding = 1), nn_batch_norm2d(cout), nn_relu(),\n",
        "      nn_max_pool2d(2), nn_dropout(0.25))\n",
        "    self$features <- nn_sequential(block(1, 32), block(32, 64))\n",
        "    self$classifier <- nn_sequential(\n",
        "      nn_flatten(),\n",
        "      nn_linear(64 * 7 * 7, 256), nn_batch_norm1d(256), nn_relu(), nn_dropout(0.4),\n",
        "      nn_linear(256, 10))\n",
        "  },\n",
        "  forward = function(x) self$classifier(self$features(x))\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "n_params <- sum(sapply(cnn()$parameters, function(p) p$numel()))\n",
        "cat(\"Trainable parameters:\", format(n_params, big.mark = \",\"), \"\\n\")"
      ]
    },
