            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "wrong <- which(val_pred != yval)\n",
        "cat(length(wrong), \"mistakes out of\", length(yval), \"validation images\\n\")\n",
        "par(mfrow = c(2, 6), mar = c(0.5, 0.5, 2, 0.5))\n",
        "for (i in head(wrong, 12)) show_digit(Xval[i, ], paste(yval[i], \"→\", val_pred[i]))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1ySBfOkvPwvz"
      },
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "## 13. Final model: an ensemble trained on all the data\n",
        "\n",
        "For the submission we make two final improvements:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Use all 42,000 training images.** We've already confirmed the approach works, so we no longer need to hold back a validation set. More data means a better model.\n",
        "2. **Ensemble several CNNs.** Each model starts from different random weights and sees different augmentations, so they make *different* mistakes. Averaging their predicted probabilities cancels out many of those individual errors. This usually adds a little extra accuracy on top of a single model.\n",
        "\n",
        "On a GPU this trains 5 models, and on a CPU it trains 1 to keep the run time sensible. Expect roughly 10–20 minutes on a GPU."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "Y95wWPbePwvz",
