      "source": [
        "## 14. Create the submission file\n",
        "\n",
        "Each test image gets the digit with the highest averaged probability. Kaggle expects exactly two columns, `ImageId` (starting at 1) and `Label`, with 28,000 rows.\n",
        "\n",
        "**To submit:** open the folder panel on the left, refresh it, right-click `submission.csv` and choose **Download**. Then upload it on the competition page under **Submit Prediction**."
      ]
